---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<Page title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Crisp & Cook.">
  <p class="small">Last updated: November 3, 2026</p>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.name} ("we", "us") at {SITE.url} collects and uses information when you visit our website.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We do not require you to create an account. We automatically collect standard, non-identifying data such as browser type, device, pages visited, and approximate location through analytics tools (Google Analytics). If you email us, we receive your email address and message.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We and our partners use cookies and similar technologies to analyze traffic, remember preferences, and show advertising. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We use third-party advertising companies, including Google AdSense, to serve ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
  <p>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow">www.aboutads.info</a>. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>We participate in affiliate programs such as Amazon Associates. When you click an affiliate link, the retailer may set cookies to track the referral.</p>
  <h2>Your rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data, and to object to its processing. Visitors from the EEA and UK will see a consent message for personalized ads. Contact us to make a request.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</Page>
